1
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Only the piano has kept me company all day

2
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The sleeping cello, quiet and worn

3
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
I think you've made it very clear

4
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
I understand, I know you feel no reluctance

5
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,000
You say you're sad too, but I don't believe it

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Holding you, being with me — it was only ever the past

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I hope he truly loves you more than I do

8
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Only then will I force myself to leave

9
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
You want me to say how hard it is — I don't want to part at all

10
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Why must I still cover it with a smile

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:41,000
I don't have that gift — to accept him along with you

12
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Don't worry too much, I'll always be doing fine

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
You've gone far away, and I'll slowly walk away too

14
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Why do I even accommodate you when we part

15
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:08,000
I really don't have that gift — to be quiet this quickly

16
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:28,000
I'll learn to give you up because I love you too much

